    "description": {
      "content": "Control-plane API for Ressl, a platform that provisions hosted mock SaaS APIs for agents and evaluations. List the mock SaaS providers your organization is granted, then create a short-lived snapshot of one provider that returns a public HTTPS base URL your agent can call. Control traffic uses simulation.ressl.ai; provisioned mock traffic is served from *.mock.ressl.cc.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Ressl",
